<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;Use block if, not postfix if&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you suggesting postfix if should &lt;b&gt;never&lt;/b&gt; be used?&lt;/p&gt;

